Get this series.

00:24:10.600 --> 00:24:14.560
Hi, my name is Simone, and I love horses.

00:24:15.290 --> 00:24:19.800
This is a story of a boy who wanted a horse so much

00:24:19.800 --> 00:24:24.610
that he made one out of mud, and it's called the Mud Pony.

00:24:25.640 --> 00:24:29.860
One day, the little boy got lost, but

00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:31.900
Something wonderful happened.

00:24:32.160 --> 00:24:34.820
His mud pony comes to life.

00:24:35.530 --> 00:24:41.830
The pony said, I am made of Mother Earth, and I will take care of you.

00:24:42.900 --> 00:24:46.020
The pony helped the boy find his mother and father.

00:24:47.930 --> 00:24:52.120
This story made me feel happy, and I think you should read it too.

